// spec: 12 Runtime panics; 8 assert
// panics: assert-kind
// A failed assert whose message is not a string panics as panic does (section 12); a passing one
// never evaluates the message.
assert(true, 1)
println("passed")
assert(false, 1)

// expect
// out: passed
// exit: 1
// err: assert needs a string message, got int
